<article class="env-lemma" id="09QR">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/09QR">Lemma <span data-tag="09QR">22.27.10</span>.</a> In Situation <a href="/tag/09QJ" data-tag="09QJ">22.27.2</a> let $f: x \to y$ be a morphism in $\text{Comp}(\mathcal{A})$. The triangle $(y, c(f), x[1], i, p, f[1])$ is the triangle associated to the admissible short exact sequence </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix{y\ar[r] &  c(f) \ar[r] &  x[1]}  \]
</div>
  <p> where the cone $c(f)$ is defined as in Lemma <a href="/tag/09P6" data-tag="09P6">22.27.1</a>. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
